      "content": "i mean i can't really go to the er right now, it's way too expensive and i have to work tomorrow. i'm pretty sure i can just manage this with some extra tylenol and maybe some vitamin c. if i just keep the lights off and sleep it off, it should be fine by morning right? i don't want to make a big deal out of nothing.",
